 "turns": [
  {
   "turn_id": "C19-D001",
   "turn_index": 0,
   "speaker": "森",
   "source_text": "おはようございます。センターの予定の確認ですね。私も一緒に行きます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C19-D001-S01",
    "C19-D001-S02",
    "C19-D001-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-9",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 0.0,
   "end_sec": 5.136,
   "duration_sec": 5.136
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C19-D002",
   "turn_index": 1,
   "speaker": "ナディア",
   "source_text": "ありがとうございます。今は10時10分です。10時半まで、ここで待ちましょう。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C19-D002-S01",
    "C19-D002-S02",
    "C19-D002-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 5.486,
   "end_sec": 10.991,
   "duration_sec": 5.505
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C19-D003",
   "turn_index": 2,
   "speaker": "森",
   "source_text": "昨日のメッセージを読みました。理由がはっきりしていますね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C19-D003-S01",
    "C19-D003-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-9",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 11.341,
   "end_sec": 15.846,
   "duration_sec": 4.505
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C19-D004",
   "turn_index": 3,
   "speaker": "ナディア",
   "source_text": "私も外で読みたいです。今回は感想も書きますから、机が欲しいです。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C19-D004-S01",
    "C19-D004-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 16.196,
   "end_sec": 22.128,
   "duration_sec": 5.932
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C19-D005",
   "turn_index": 4,
   "speaker": "森",
   "source_text": "なるほど。14日はセンターがいいと思います。公園には10月に行きましょう。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C19-D005-S01",
    "C19-D005-S02",
    "C19-D005-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-9",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 22.478,
   "end_sec": 28.865,
   "duration_sec": 6.387
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C19-D006",
   "turn_index": 5,
   "speaker": "ナディア",
   "source_text": "10月の土曜日ですね。涼しい日の公園は、本当にいいですね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C19-D006-S01",
    "C19-D006-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 29.215,
   "end_sec": 33.9,
   "duration_sec": 4.685
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C19-D007",
   "turn_index": 6,
   "speaker": "森",
   "source_text": "ええ。私はずっと、外の読書会はいいと思っています。雨の日も外で読みますよ。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C19-D007-S01",
    "C19-D007-S02",
    "C19-D007-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-9",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 34.25,
   "end_sec": 40.363,
   "duration_sec": 6.113
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C19-D008",
   "turn_index": 7,
   "speaker": "ナディア",
   "source_text": "えっ、本当ですか。本は大丈夫ですか。驚きました。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C19-D008-S01",
    "C19-D008-S02",
    "C19-D008-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 40.713,
   "end_sec": 46.011,
   "duration_sec": 5.298
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C19-D009",
   "turn_index": 8,
   "speaker": "森",
   "source_text": "すみません、うそです。雨の日は家で読みます。10月はたぶん涼しいと思います。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C19-D009-S01",
    "C19-D009-S02",
    "C19-D009-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-9",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 46.361,
   "end_sec": 52.578,
   "duration_sec": 6.217
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C19-D010",
   "turn_index": 9,
   "speaker": "ナディア",
   "source_text": "10月の予定は全員で相談しましょう。木村さんの返事はどうですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C19-D010-S01",
    "C19-D010-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 52.928,
   "end_sec": 58.323,
   "duration_sec": 5.395
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C19-D011",
   "turn_index": 10,
   "speaker": "森",
   "source_text": "昨夜、私に「14日も公園で読みたいです」と言いました。電話の前には、まだナディアさんのメッセージを読んでいませんでした。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C19-D011-S01",
    "C19-D011-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-9",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 58.673,
   "end_sec": 68.234,
   "duration_sec": 9.561
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C19-D012",
   "turn_index": 11,
   "speaker": "ナディア",
   "source_text": "そうですか。木村さんの意見も直接聞きたいです。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C19-D012-S01",
    "C19-D012-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 68.584,
   "end_sec": 72.923,
   "duration_sec": 4.339
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C19-D013",
   "turn_index": 12,
   "speaker": "森",
   "source_text": "後で私が話します。今朝はトムさんが電話で連絡しました。「14日はセンターで会いたいです」と言いました。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C19-D013-S01",
    "C19-D013-S02",
    "C19-D013-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-9",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 73.273,
   "end_sec": 81.169,
   "duration_sec": 7.896
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C19-D014",
   "turn_index": 13,
   "speaker": "ナディア",
   "source_text": "それぞれの意見を書きますね。現在、センターは三人、公園は一人。上田さんはまだですね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C19-D014-S01",
    "C19-D014-S02",
    "C19-D014-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 81.519,
   "end_sec": 89.195,
   "duration_sec": 7.676
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C19-D015",
   "turn_index": 14,
   "speaker": "森",
   "source_text": "はい。ところで、別の話題です。上田さんの料理の本の提案はどうですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C19-D015-S01",
    "C19-D015-S02",
    "C19-D015-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-9",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 89.545,
   "end_sec": 95.32,
   "duration_sec": 5.775
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C19-D016",
   "turn_index": 15,
   "speaker": "ナディア",
   "source_text": "いいと思います。確か、短い本を読みたいと言いましたね。もう一度確認します。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C19-D016-S01",
    "C19-D016-S02",
    "C19-D016-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 95.67,
   "end_sec": 101.677,
   "duration_sec": 6.007
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C19-D017",
   "turn_index": 16,
   "speaker": "森",
   "source_text": "上田さんはブログで料理の話も書いていますよ。昨日の発言の後で、私とメッセージのやり取りをしました。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C19-D017-S01",
    "C19-D017-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-9",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 102.027,
   "end_sec": 109.475,
   "duration_sec": 7.448
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C19-D018",
   "turn_index": 17,
   "speaker": "ナディア",
   "source_text": "へえ。例えば、どんな料理ですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C19-D018-S01",
    "C19-D018-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 109.825,
   "end_sec": 112.884,
   "duration_sec": 3.059
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C19-D019",
   "turn_index": 18,
   "speaker": "森",
   "source_text": "一つ例を挙げます。鍋に油を入れて、玉葱ともも肉を炒めます。それから、だしとみりんを入れて煮ます。最後にグリーンピースを入れます。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C19-D019-S01",
    "C19-D019-S02",
    "C19-D019-S03",
    "C19-D019-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-9",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 113.234,
   "end_sec": 124.046,
   "duration_sec": 10.812
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C19-D020",
   "turn_index": 19,
   "speaker": "ナディア",
   "source_text": "ああ、おいしいと思います。だしは英語で何と言いますか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C19-D020-S01",
    "C19-D020-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 124.396,
   "end_sec": 129.311,
   "duration_sec": 4.915
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C19-D021",
   "turn_index": 20,
   "speaker": "森",
   "source_text": "日本料理のだしは英語でも「dashi」と言います。私は昨日、餃子も作りました。小麦粉に水を入れて、よくこねました。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C19-D021-S01",
    "C19-D021-S02",
    "C19-D021-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-9",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": true,
   "review_flags": [
    "clip_asr_difference",
    "low_ASR_text_match"
   ],
   "start_sec": 129.661,
   "end_sec": 139.083,
   "duration_sec": 9.422
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C19-D022",
   "turn_index": 21,
   "speaker": "ナディア",
   "source_text": "すごいですね。皮も自分で作りましたか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C19-D022-S01",
    "C19-D022-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 139.433,
   "end_sec": 143.066,
   "duration_sec": 3.633
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C19-D023",
   "turn_index": 22,
   "speaker": "森",
   "source_text": "もちろん。皮で肉を包みました。半分は蒸して、半分は焼きました。八時に出来上がりました。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C19-D023-S01",
    "C19-D023-S02",
    "C19-D023-S03",
    "C19-D023-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-9",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 143.416,
   "end_sec": 151.316,
   "duration_sec": 7.9
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C19-D024",
   "turn_index": 23,
   "speaker": "ナディア",
   "source_text": "私はいつも餃子を茹でます。その方法もいいですね。今度、写真を見せてください。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C19-D024-S01",
    "C19-D024-S02",
    "C19-D024-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 151.666,
   "end_sec": 157.563,
   "duration_sec": 5.897
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C19-D025",
   "turn_index": 24,
   "speaker": "森",
   "source_text": "ええ。今朝、上田さんに会って、写真を見せました。上田さんは頷いて、にっこりとしましたよ。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C19-D025-S01",
    "C19-D025-S02",
    "C19-D025-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-9",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": true,
   "review_flags": [
    "clip_asr_difference",
    "low_ASR_text_match"
   ],
   "start_sec": 157.913,
   "end_sec": 164.748,
   "duration_sec": 6.835
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C19-D026",
   "turn_index": 25,
   "speaker": "ナディア",
   "source_text": "楽しみです。まず、場所と本を決めましょう。センターの部屋はたぶん大丈夫だと思います。まだ確認していません。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C19-D026-S01",
    "C19-D026-S02",
    "C19-D026-S03",
    "C19-D026-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 165.098,
   "end_sec": 172.932,
   "duration_sec": 7.834
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C19-D027",
   "turn_index": 26,
   "speaker": "森",
   "source_text": "全員の返事もまだですね。部屋の確認が先ですね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C19-D027-S01",
    "C19-D027-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-9",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 173.282,
   "end_sec": 177.261,
   "duration_sec": 3.979
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C19-D028",
   "turn_index": 27,
   "speaker": "ナディア",
   "source_text": "はい。確認した後で、チャットで知らせます。トムさんの意見も伝えてください。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C19-D028-S01",
    "C19-D028-S02",
    "C19-D028-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-advisor-12",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 177.611,
   "end_sec": 182.666,
   "duration_sec": 5.055
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C19-D029",
   "turn_index": 28,
   "speaker": "森",
   "source_text": "はい。あっ、10時半です。中に入りましょう。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C19-D029-S01",
    "C19-D029-S02",
    "C19-D029-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-9",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 183.016,
   "end_sec": 186.358,
   "duration_sec": 3.342
  }
 ],
 "sentence_intervals": [
